The 4-warp packing variant is mixed but slightly better on the smaller cases. I’ll keep it temporarily and look for larger wins in projection/layernorm, where the profile shows most time is spent.
codex
For masked cases, half the pair rows are zeroed after projection. I’m changing the mask packing kernels so rows with `mask == 0` skip projection/gate loads and sigmoid work, while still storing zeros for the dense batched GEMM.
apply patch
